        },
        "af": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Op die sleutelbord, maak Klembord oop vanaf die gereedskapkieslys en tik 'n snit om dit te plak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the keyboard, open it from the tools menu and start talking.": {
